:: Isabel - secret contact [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHTCLUB</h1>
<br />

<center>
	<<image 'places/underground/nightclub_head.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

A woman you didn't recognize brushed past you at the bar, close enough that it couldn't have been an accident. She didn't stop, didn't look at you twice.

<br /><br />

<<newgirl>>
<<set _icNpc = $tmpGirl>>
<<sayNpc _icNpc>>
	Bathroom. Give it a minute.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

She was already gone by the time the words registered, swallowed back into the crowd like she'd never been there at all. You stood there a moment, turning it over. Whoever sent her wanted to make sure it couldn't be traced back to them.

<br /><br />

<<link 'Go to the bathroom'>>
	<<goto 'Nightclub - bathroom'>>
<</link>>
<<link 'Ignore it'>>
	<<goto 'Nightclub - inside'>>
<</link>>
